### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension. Server: npm start
@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### Create product
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Laptop Stand", "sku": "ELEC-010", "category": "electronics", "price": 1299, "quantity": 25, "reorderLevel": 10, "supplier": "DeskCo" }

### List: filter + sort + paginate
GET {{base}}/products?category=electronics&minPrice=200&maxPrice=5000&inStock=true&sort=-price,name&page=1&limit=5

### Search + field projection
GET {{base}}/products?search=pen&fields=name,sku,price

### Get one (replace ID)
GET {{base}}/products/PUT_ID_HERE

### Update details
PUT {{base}}/products/PUT_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 1499, "supplier": "NewSupplier" }

### Restock
PATCH {{base}}/products/PUT_ID_HERE/restock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 20 }

### Sale
PATCH {{base}}/products/PUT_ID_HERE/sell
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 3 }

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/products/PUT_ID_HERE

### Low-stock report (per-product reorderLevel, or ?threshold=25)
GET {{base}}/reports/low-stock

### Category-wise summary (aggregation)
GET {{base}}/reports/category-summary
